      "time_allocation": "45h (60 sessions) contact hours + 1h final exam + 104h self-study",
      "pre_requisite": "CSD203, CPV301",
      "description": "Image & Video Processing is an advanced course that covers the fundamental principles, techniques, and applications of image and video processing. The course explores manipulating digital images and videos to extract useful information, enhance visual quality, and perform analysis. It covers various topics, including image acquisition and digitization, image enhancement and restoration, image compression and coding, image segmentation and feature extraction, and object recognition and tracking. The course also covers fundamental concepts in video processing, including video coding and compression, motion estimation, and video analysis. Students will learn to process images and videos using various tools and software platforms, including MATLAB and Python.",
      "studenttasks": "- Students must attend at least 80% of contact slots in order to be accepted to the final examination.\n- Student is responsible to do all exercises, assignments and labs given by instructor in class or at home and submit on time\n- Use laptop in class only for learning purpose\n- Promptly access to the FU LMS at http://flm.fpt.edu.vn for up-to-date course information",
      "tools": "No",
      "scoring_scale": "10",
      "decisionno_mm_dd_yyyy": "1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 11/27/2025",
      "isapproved": "True",
      "note": "1) On-going Assessment\n- 2 Assignments: 40%\n- 2 progress tests: 20%\n2) 1 Final Exam: 40%\n3) Final Result 100% (The Final result - including bonus score - is not greater than 10)\nCompletion Criteria:\n1) Every on-going assessment component > 0\n2) Final Exam Score >= 4 & Final Result >= 5\nBonus score for accepted paper (email accepted/ published).\nISI/Scopus Q1, Q2: 5\nISI/Scopus Q3, Q4: 3\nScopus Q1, Q2: 3\nScopus Q3, Q4: 2\nThe accepted paper must be related to topics in AI17_COM2 and be assessed by the in-class Lecturer.\nSource to check Scopus ranking: https://www.scimagojr.com/\nSource to check ISI: https://mjl.clarivate.com",
